From: ignaciopd3 <210892957+ignaciopd3@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 12:37:23 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 32/32] Casa: Home Assistant as a second source and the doorbell card
 with live video

HaWatch feeds the same roles and messages as Tuya's cloud; the yellow key switches through Home Assistant when the
light is there. A ring opens the doorbell card (TimbreService in its own :timbre process, libwebrtc over Home
Assistant's WebRTC, buttons held 1.5 s to open, only after a real ring); motion shows the small capsule or a muted
card. ConfigProvider takes ha.json from tv-opt's run.py casa send.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
